<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
}
.header {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 80pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 25pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 32pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  margin: 100pt 40pt 60pt 40pt;
}
h2 {
  font-size: 22pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 15pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
ul {
  margin: 0 0 15pt 0;
  padding-left: 30pt;
  font-size: 17pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>核心策略：哑铃型配置，攻守兼备</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <h2>2025年市场关键词</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>流动性改善</li>
    <li>技术革新</li>
    <li>价值重估</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>投资主线</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>硬科技成长：AI、光通信</li>
    <li>高红利防守：黄金、高股息</li>
  </ul>
</div>
</body>
</html>
